id: being-a-copy
name: Being a Copy
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Copy Being's Copy, while it lasts - set as Copy Being is used, gone with a Defeat, the Combat Encounter's end or a
# failed Steadfast Check; taken off by hand for its Instant Maneuver. The copying itself is the table's (Copyman's "While you are not a Copy").
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Being a Copy: Copy Being's - you are a Copy of another Character.
text: >
  Copy Being: You can only use Copy Being once per Combat Encounter, and you stop being a Copy if you are Defeated, the Combat Encounter ends, or if you fail a Steadfast Check. You can also stop being a Copy as an Instant Maneuver.

---
